# Build context is the repo root, so BuildKit reads this file (named after the
# Dockerfile) ahead of any context-root .dockerignore. podinfo clones its own
# source in the builder, so nothing here is COPYed in; this only keeps the
# context small and free of secrets.
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
terraform
kubernetes
monitoring
gitops
cicd
docs
scripts
docker/nginx
*.md
